{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23653","headline":"和杨郎中贺杨仆射致仕後杨侍郎门生合宴席上作 · 白居易","name":"和杨郎中贺杨仆射致仕後杨侍郎门生合宴席上作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业重关西继大名，恩深阙下遂高情。\n祥鱣降伴趋庭鲤，贺燕飞和出谷莺。\n范蠡舟中无子弟，疏家席上欠门生。\n可怜玉树连桃李，从古无如此会荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}